### Removed payment channels
#
# This file is documentation only. It intentionally contains no executable HTTP
# requests so removed payment channels cannot be sent accidentally.
#
# GECARD and TRCARD stopped working in Capitalist and their active request
# examples were removed on 2026-09-01. Keep the former payload shapes here in
# case the channels are reintroduced or their removal history needs review.
# Before restoring either example, verify the current official API documentation
# and confirm that the channel is operational in Capitalist.

### GECARD — removed Georgian card channel
# Former payload shape:
# {
#   "type": "GECARD",
#   "account": "<card number>",
#   "senderFirstname": "<sender first name>",
#   "senderLastname": "<sender last name>",
#   "senderIdentityNumber": "<sender identity number>",
#   "receiverFirstname": "<receiver first name>",
#   "receiverLastname": "<receiver last name>"
# }

### TRCARD — removed Turkish card channel
# Former payload shape:
# {
#   "type": "TRCARD",
#   "account": "<card number>",
#   "senderFullname": "<sender full name>",
#   "senderIdentityNumber": "<sender identity number>",
#   "beneficiaryFullname": "<beneficiary full name>"
# }
